--- !u!114 &219236567
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 219236565}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb0115ab550010248ad569d0116cf47c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  DialogueLines:
  - Eleanor?
  - "Eleanor, it\u2019s Thomas, it\u2019s daddy."
  - I- have you been watching me this whole time?
  - "Look, I can explain. I know I haven\u2019t made the best choices recently, but
    it's all for you. "
  - And your mother of course, is she with you?
  - "Ah, I suppose that\u2019s punishment for all I\u2019ve done."
  - "In any case, the farm has been thriving recently so I\u2019m clearly doing something
    right\u2026 Right?"
  - "And the thing with Margaret, I apologised for that. And I also told her brothers
    no when they suggested we marry so\u2026"
  - "Please, Eleanor. Don\u2019t look at me like that. I\u2019ve been doing my best
    but it's hard."
  - "Eleanor, please don\u2019t leave, I can\u2019t lose you again."
  NPCName: Thomas
